    "description": "Shree Cement Ventures Solutions is actively seeking a talented and motivated Plant Manager to join our dynamic team in Ranchi. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Shree Cement Ventures Solutions:\nShree Cement Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Maintain accurate production records and prepare daily reports\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Implement 5S, Kaizen, and Six Sigma practices on the shop floor\n• Prepare production cost analysis and efficiency reports\n• Ensure environmental compliance and waste management\n• Train and supervise shop floor workers and supervisors\n• Manage raw material procurement and inventory levels\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science or related discipline\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in GD&T\n• Proficiency in SAP MM/PP\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n• Proficiency in Project Management\n• Proficiency in Kaizen\n• Proficiency in Root Cause Analysis\n• Proficiency in SolidWorks\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Learning & development budget\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Ranchi, Jharkhand, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Shree Cement Ventures Solutions!",
